      "writtenOn": "2023-03-03T18:53:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I\u0027ve tried this out locally and it works, but this seems to be the intent of FutureApiLevel (e.g. \u0027current\u0027), which is what MinApiForArch currently returns.\n\nArguably, isn\u0027t how we\u0027re modifying in `ab.vndkVersion` incorrect? It\u0027s replacing \"current\" with \"PlatformVersionName\", which changes the meaning (the former is the \u0027latest\u0027 and the latter is the \u0027latest active preview\u0027).",
      "parentUuid": "c414b445_ee9fda79",
      "revId": "9f50668d13501f5873fc1c7f5f17ab5ea0f90ef1",
